{"id":"0d1cb776524abeca","group":"67","path":"67/67-thm-disjoint-numerations.md","title":"Simultaneous Numeration of Disjoint Sets","display":"thm-disjoint-numerations — Simultaneous Numeration of Disjoint Sets","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-thm-disjoint-numerations","aliases":["67-thm-disjoint-numerations"],"display":"thm-disjoint-numerations — Simultaneous Numeration of Disjoint Sets","depends_on":["[[67-df-numeration]]","[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]"],"source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"source_chapter":3,"source_label":"Theorem 2","source_printed_pages":"43–44","source_pdf_pages":"54–55","source_proof_status":"陈述已核对；未独立完成全部基础事实或原书证明的形式验证"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-thm-disjoint-numerations"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-thm-disjoint-numerations</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-disjoint-numerations — Simultaneous Numeration of Disjoint Sets"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9c200c8ec3685766\" href=\"?note=9c200c8ec3685766\" title=\"67-df-numeration\">67-df-numeration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Theorem 2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"43–44"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"54–55"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"陈述已核对；未独立完成全部基础事实或原书证明的形式验证"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\supseteq Q\">\\(T\\supseteq Q\\)</span> 为一致原始递归公理呈示，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_0,X_1\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(X_0,X_1\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为不交递归可枚举集合。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Num}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Num}_T\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9c200c8ec3685766\" href=\"?note=9c200c8ec3685766\" title=\"67-df-numeration\">67-df-numeration</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}\\)</span> 为至多一个自由变量的算术公式集合。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}\\)</span> 在本原子精确指 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\xi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}:\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\xi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\}\">\\(\\{\\xi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}:\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\xi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 是数词实例 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\xi(\\bar n)\">\\(\\xi(\\bar n)\\)</span> 中被代入的指定变量。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\xi\\in\\Sigma_1\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}\\quad\n\\mathrm{Num}_T(\\xi,X_0)\\land\\mathrm{Num}_T(\\neg\\xi,X_1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\xi\\in\\Sigma_1\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}\\quad\n\\mathrm{Num}_T(\\xi,X_0)\\land\\mathrm{Num}_T(\\neg\\xi,X_1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 3.2, pp.43–44。同一个 Σ1 公式分别以自身和否定的可证明性精确列举两集合；不只是标准模型中的分离，也不把非成员全部判为反面可证。源证明采用两边枚举证据与正反证明的 Rosser 比较。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-numeration","status":"resolved","id":"9c200c8ec3685766","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-numeration]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-numeration","status":"resolved","id":"9c200c8ec3685766","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Num}_T$ 见 [[67-df-numeration]]，$\\Sigma_1$ 见 [[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]，$\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}$ 为至多一个自由变量的算术公式集合。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Num}_T$ 见 [[67-df-numeration]]，$\\Sigma_1$ 见 [[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]，$\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}$ 为至多一个自由变量的算术公式集合。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\supseteq Q","display":false},{"tex":"X_0,X_1\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Num}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\xi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}:\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\xi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\xi(\\bar n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists\\xi\\in\\Sigma_1\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}\\quad\n\\mat